msgstr "更改或移除子项目使用的 ``/projects/`` 前缀"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/url-path-prefixes.rst:42
msgid "Use cases"
msgstr "使用场景"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/url-path-prefixes.rst:44
msgid "Here are some common scenarios where custom URL path prefixes are useful:"
msgstr "以下是自定义 URL 路径前缀的常见场景："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/url-path-prefixes.rst:46
msgid "Proxy documentation behind your main website"
msgstr "将文档代理到主站之后"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/url-path-prefixes.rst:47
msgid ""
"If you want to serve your documentation as part of your main website (for "
"example, at ``https://example.com/docs/``), you can configure your web "
"server to proxy requests to Read the Docs and use a custom prefix of "
"``/docs/`` to match. Your documentation would then be served from "
"``https://example.com/docs/en/latest/`` instead of "
"``https://example.com/en/latest/``."
msgstr ""
"若想把文档作为主站的一部分提供（例如在 ``https://example.com/docs/``），可配置 Web 服务器将请求代理到 Read "
"the Docs，并使用 ``/docs/`` 作为匹配的自定义前缀。这样文档将从 "
"``https://example.com/docs/en/latest/`` 而非 "
"``https://example.com/en/latest/`` 提供。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/url-path-prefixes.rst:54
msgid "Remove or customize the ``/projects/`` prefix from subproject URLs"
msgstr "移除或自定义子项目 URL 的 ``/projects/`` 前缀"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/url-path-prefixes.rst:55
msgid ""
"By default, subprojects are served from URLs like "
"``https://docs.example.com/projects/plugin/en/latest/``. You can change this"
" prefix to something shorter or remove it entirely, so your subproject is "
"served from ``https://docs.example.com/plugin/en/latest/`` or "
"``https://docs.example.com/libs/plugin/en/latest/``."
msgstr ""
"默认子项目从类似 ``https://docs.example.com/projects/plugin/en/latest/`` 的 URL "
"提供。你可以将此前缀改得更短或完全移除，使子项目从 ``https://docs.example.com/plugin/en/latest/`` 或 "
"``https://docs.example.com/libs/plugin/en/latest/`` 提供。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/url-path-prefixes.rst:61
msgid "Organize documentation with meaningful URL paths"
msgstr "用有意义的 URL 路径组织文档"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/url-path-prefixes.rst:62
msgid ""
"You can use prefixes to create a more meaningful URL structure. For example,"
" you could use ``/api/`` for API documentation and ``/guides/`` for user "
"guides."
msgstr "你可以用前缀构建更有意义的 URL 结构。例如用 ``/api/`` 放 API 文档，用 ``/guides/`` 放用户指南。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/url-path-prefixes.rst:67
msgid "Getting started"
msgstr "快速开始"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/url-path-prefixes.rst:69
msgid "To enable this feature for your project:"
msgstr "为你的项目启用此功能："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/url-path-prefixes.rst:71
msgid "Ensure you have a Pro plan or higher subscription."
msgstr "确保你持有 Pro 或更高套餐订阅。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/url-path-prefixes.rst:72
msgid ""
"Contact :doc:`Read the Docs support </support>` with your project name and "
"desired URL structure."
msgstr "联系 :doc:`Read the Docs 支持 </support>`，提供项目名称和期望的 URL 结构。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/url-path-prefixes.rst:74
msgid "Our support team will configure the custom prefixes for your project."
msgstr "我们的支持团队会为你的项目配置自定义前缀。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/url-path-prefixes.rst:78
msgid ""
"When planning your URL structure, consider how it will affect existing links"
" to your documentation. You may need to set up :doc:`redirects </user-"
"defined-redirects>` to ensure old URLs continue to work."
msgstr ""
"规划 URL 结构时，请考虑它对现有文档链接的影响。你可能需要设置 :doc:`重定向 </user-defined-redirects>` 以确保旧 "
"URL 继续可用。"

